            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Notas da Atualização</h1><p>Trading Cards!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/615490/extras/0f2d8ee5d69af0e62d6fdc787dae4fac.avif?t=1525870142\" width=548 height=214 /></span><br><br>Hi everybody,<br><br>The trading cards are officially available.<br><br>Enjoy!</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>HOW AWESOME ARE YOU?<br><br>The world is falling apart and you need to... keep it messy! Forget heroism. Do whatever you want, you're here to be awesome!<br><br>** FEATURES **<br><br>CRAZY ACTION BEAT'EM UP!<br><br>ARCADE AND RANKING<br>Get the most points and reach the top rank.<br><br>LOCAL MULTIPLAYER<br>Join your friends and play in cooperative mode, OR NOT, if you want to beat them head on!<br><br>15 ACHIEVEMENTS<br>Find and get all achievements. 3 of them are secret!<br><br>12 TRADING CARDS<br>Collect them all!<br><br>THANKS<br><br>You ARE awesome! B-]",
            "about_the_game": "HOW AWESOME ARE YOU?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe world is falling apart and you need to... keep it messy! Forget heroism. Do whatever you want, you're here to be awesome!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n** FEATURES **<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCRAZY ACTION BEAT'EM UP!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nARCADE AND RANKING<br />\r\nGet the most points and reach the top rank.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLOCAL MULTIPLAYER<br />\r\nJoin your friends and play in cooperative mode, OR NOT, if you want to beat them head on!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n15 ACHIEVEMENTS<br />\r\nFind and get all achievements. 3 of them are secret!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n12 TRADING CARDS<br />\r\nCollect them all!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTHANKS<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou ARE awesome! B-]",
            "short_description": "How awesome are you? This is an action beat'em up game, where you can do a bunch of insane things with people! Punch and kick dwarves and grandpas, dance the Rumba, get the Unicorn Bazooka and have fun. Get a lot of points and reach the TOP!",
