                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It opened on the wrong monitor on a multi-screen setup, controller support is wonky (sometimes your buttons will work, sometimes not) and there is nothing much to do except run around like a buffoon and punch people, watching them comically rocket off the screen, grabbing the occasional powerup to finally do something different for a few seconds.  I paid $2.30 CAD for this game, played it eight minutes, and immediately requested a refund. You may be awesome, but this game is anything but. DO NOT waste your time.",
